slipstream-logo.txt and slipstream-logo-stacked.txt are the word SLIPSTREAM in Slipstream's own
lettering: heavy slab letters cut by thin slits, drawn on the wallpapers' quarter-cell grid.
Regenerate with:

    python3 slipstream-logo.py slipstream-logo

readme/wordmark-dark.svg and readme/wordmark-light.svg are the same letters as vector shapes, in the
logo's amber, mint and cyan and in deeper shades of them for light pages. Regenerate with:

    python3 slipstream-wordmark.py readme/wordmark
